      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Genesect est un Pokémon insecte du paléozoïque\nqui a été modifié par une certaine organisation.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl peut être équipé de quatre différents types\nde modules.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et il se trouve que je possède ces quatre modules !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200069006C002000730065002000740072006F00750076006500200071007500650020006A006500200070006F0073007300E800640065002000630065007300200071007500610074007200650020006D006F00640075006C00650073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi t’essaierais pas de les obtenir ?\nSi t’y arrives, je te révélerai un secret.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’ai dit de te procurer les quatre modules !\nIls sont à toi contre quelques Méga-Fragments.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt si c’est tes Pokémon qui les tiennent, retire-les\npour les ranger dans ta Sacoche.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 184
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien. T’as enfin obtenu les quatre modules.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVu que tu m’as sagement obéi, je vais te révéler\nun secret...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’envoie tout ça sur ton Motismart.\n... Et hop, c’est transmis !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007420190065006E0076006F0069006500200074006F00750074002000E70061002000730075007200200074006F006E0020004D006F007400690073006D006100720074002E000A002E002E002E00200045007400200068006F0070002C0020006320190065007300740020007400720061006E0073006D00690073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vas-y, rends-toi aux coordonnées que je t’ai\nenvoyées. Tu le regretteras pas.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
